        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you \r\n\r\n4 Bedroom 2 Bathroom renovated Mid Terrace Family Home \r\n\r\nAttic Conversion \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and LWK are delighted to prescent 56 Clune Road, Finglas, Dublin 11, D11 T6F2\r\nA beautifully renovated four-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace family home, ideally situated in the highly sought-after area of Finglas East, Dublin 11. This impressive property has been thoughtfully renovated throughout to a high standard, offering spacious and versatile accommodation along with excellent outdoor space and convenient access to a wide range of local amenities.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, the property immediately benefits from off-street parking for two cars and a newly laid driveway. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting hallway with excellent additional storage. To the left is the comfortable family living room, providing an ideal space for relaxing and spending time together. Continuing through the property, you arrive at a generous dining room/second reception room, which provides an excellent additional living and entertaining space. Large French doors open directly onto the rear garden, creating a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor areas.\r\n\r\nThe rear garden is a fantastic feature of this home and is particularly well suited to family life and entertaining. A large tiled patio leads into an expansive rear garden, providing plenty of room for children to play, outdoor dining and family gatherings. The garden continues further to a wooden decked area and then extends beyond this, offering substantial additional space that could potentially suit a garden cabin, home office or similar use, subject to the necessary planning requirements. There is also a useful storage shed positioned towards the rear of the garden.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a newly installed kitchen featuring attractive subway-style tiling, ample base and eye-level storage units and excellent practical workspace. Quality flooring has been installed throughout the home, complemented by quality finishes and tasteful décor, creating a comfortable and contemporary family environment.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms along with the family bathroom. The two main bedrooms are spacious doubles one with  wardrobes providing excellent storage, while the third bedroom is currently arranged as a single bedroom and is being used as an office, demonstrating the accommodation's flexibility. The property is further enhanced by a large dormer attic conversion with en-suite facilities, providing valuable additional accommodation that could be used in various ways, including as the fourth  bedroom, home office, guest space or additional family living area.\r\n\r\nThe house has been carefully renovated with modern family living in mind, offering generous accommodation, excellent storage, quality finishes and an exceptional rear garden. The combination of two reception areas, a modern kitchen, three bedrooms on the first floor and the additional attic accommodation makes this a highly versatile home for a growing family.\r\n\r\nThe location is another major attraction. Clune Road is situated within the established residential community of Finglas East, close to a wide selection of local shops, supermarkets, cafés, pharmacies, schools, parks, sporting facilities and community amenities. Families are particularly well catered for, with a number of primary and secondary schools located within easy reach of the property, including St Canice's Girls National School, St Canice's Boys National School, Gaelscoil Uí Earcáin, Beneavin De La Salle College and St Michael's Holy Faith Secondary School.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from excellent public transport links, with a number of bus services operating in the surrounding area and providing convenient connections towards Dublin city centre and other parts of north Dublin. The location is also well positioned for access to DCU, Glasnevin, Ballymun and Dublin Airport, while the M50 motorway is readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity to the wider Dublin area.\r\n\r\nDublin city centre is approximately 5–6 km away, making this an attractive location for commuters who want the convenience of being close to the city while still enjoying the space and amenities of an established residential neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nOverall, 56 Clune Road is a superb family home which has been extensively renovated and thoughtfully designed to provide comfortable, modern and flexible accommodation. With its generous rear garden, off-street parking, newly fitted kitchen, quality finishes, additional attic accommodation and excellent location close to schools, transport links and local amenities, this property offers an excellent opportunity for a new and growing family looking for a substantial home in Dublin 11.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
